    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dunno, it feels like \"smart standards\" is just a way to keep things from actually changing. if we really want to unleash innovation like the post says, shouldn't we just admit that most regulations are basically just roadblocks created by politicians? is there really a \"middle ground\" or is it always going to be a choice between growth and red tape?",
